    "body": "@iainireland is right, this is a problem with \"notify one\". It probably also bears to note that these were designed to implement condition variables and mutexes and so forth, and for condition variables, \"notify one\" and \"notify all\" are the common cases.\r\n\r\nEdit: Clarified original post to pass 1 for count to `Atomics.notify`.",
